<title>USA: Foamex Q4 shr profit $0.36 vs loss $2.40.</title>
<headline>Foamex Q4 shr profit $0.36 vs loss $2.40.</headline>
<dateline>LINWOOD, Penn. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Statement of Operations (unaudited)(a) ($ Thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			  4th Quarter Comparative  Fiscal Year</p>
<p>			     1996	  1995	1996     1995</p>
<p>Net Sales		$230,007    $210,906  $926,351  $862,834</p>
<p>Gross Profit	     39,074	 4,078   153,232   100,749</p>
<p>Selling, General &amp; Administrative</p>
