<p> Operations		30,493     (60,478)  101,444  (10,581)</p>
<p>Interest and Debt</p>
<p> Issuance Expense	14,158	13,299    53,900    52,878</p>
<p>Other Income (Expense)    614	  (648)    1,617	 461</p>
<p>Income (Loss) from Continuing Operations Before Provision</p>
<p>  For Income Taxes     16,949     (74,425)   49,161  (62,998)</p>
