<p> of Income Taxes	   (744)	   --    (1,147)	--</p>
<p>Net Income (Loss)	$9,058    $(62,529) ($83,135)$(53,120)</p>
<p>Earnings (Loss) Per Share:</p>
<p>Continuing Operations   $0.50	$(2.19)   $1.27   $(1.92)</p>
<p>Discontinued Operations (0.11)	(0.21)   (4.47)   (0.09)</p>
<p>Extraordinary Loss(b)   (0.03)	 0.00    (0.05)    0.00</p>
<p>Earnings (Loss) Per</p>
<p> Share			$0.36	$(2.40)  $(3.25)  $(2.01)</p>
<p>EBDAIT (c)		$29,444	$4,584  $117,256  $71,544</p>
<p>Notes:</p>
<p>(a) The Consolidated Statements of Operations and Net Sales by Product Category for all periods have been restated to reflect JPS Automotive L.P.  and Perfect Fit Industries Inc  as discontinued operations.</p>
<p>(b) Extraordinary loss represents charges associated with the early extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>(c) EBDAIT consists of earnings before depreciation, amortization, interest, income taxes and other non-cash or non-recurring expenses.</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Foamex International Inc.</p>
